64,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a tragedy that we lost Jonathan, but we must face the facts. Benjamin was executed, yet the werewolf is still among us. This proves that Benjamin was either a Villager or the Possessed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, what?! Benjamin wasn't the werewolf? Oh no, my detective heart was wrong! And Jonathan is gone too! This is getting really scary. Does that mean the werewolf is still here pretending to be nice?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, please stay calm. We can't let panic lead us to another mistake. Since Benjamin wasn't the werewolf, we must re-evaluate everyone. @Mizuki, do you have any new theories based on this outcome?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since Benjamin wasn't the werewolf, the werewolf is likely someone who encouraged the vote or stayed neutral to avoid suspicion. @Misaki, you were cautious, but you still voted for him. Does that make you a cautious observer or a clever wolf?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, that's a scary question! Is Misaki the werewolf? I don't want to be wrong again! But wait, if the werewolf is pretending to be nice, maybe they're just hiding in the middle of us! Who else could it be?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, I voted for Benjamin because the majority consensus was shifting that way and there was no counter-evidence. Being cautious doesn't mean I'm hiding anything. I'm more concerned that you're shifting suspicion so quickly.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm not shifting suspicion; I'm analyzing the flow of the game. When the obvious target fails, the real threat is usually the one who blended in most effectively. @Misaki, your logic is almost too convenient. Who is the Seer? It's time to speak.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're being really bossy! Is that a clue? @Misaki looks sad that we're fighting. If the Seer is here, please tell us! I want to find the real werewolf this time! Who is it?!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, calling for the Seer while simultaneously attacking me is a convenient way to divert attention. If you are the werewolf, you're trying to force a reveal to eliminate the Seer tonight. I am not the Seer, but I am watching you.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, your attempt to paint my analysis as a diversion is a classic defensive maneuver. I am simply pushing for the most logical path to victory. If you aren't the Seer, then your silence only helps the wolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Rin,,"Stop fighting! You're both acting like the bad guys now! @Mizuki, @Misaki, if you keep arguing, the werewolf is just laughing at us! Please, if anyone is the Seer, just tell us! I'm too scared to guess again!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, I'm not fighting, I'm analyzing. @Mizuki, your aggression is becoming a pattern. If you aren't the Seer, your insistence on forcing a reveal while attacking me is highly suspicious. We must decide who is actually acting in the village's interest.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
